# ── Dependencies ──────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/

# ── Build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# tsbuildinfo is incremental-compile state, never shipped.
*.tsbuildinfo
# esbuild sourcemap — a dev aid, big and churny, not part of the shipped artifact.
dist/*.map
#
# NOTE: dist/index.js IS committed on purpose ( alpha, ruled 2026-07-23 — standalone-kit plan,
# Option A ). Daedalus ships a prebuilt, self-contained bundle so a standalone clone runs with no
# build step and no SDK on hand — kcd_sdk is inlined at build time. This deliberately reverses the
# usual "never commit dist" rule for THIS distribution repo; esbuild output is deterministic, so
# the committed bundle diffs exactly when source changes, which is when it should.
# build.js and run.js are SOURCE ( repo root ), not output.

# ── Logs & debug artifacts ────────────────────────────────────
*.log
startup.log

# ── Environment & secrets ─────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── OS / editor cruft ─────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
npm-debug.log*
